  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你散发着密阿雷的气息……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60656353D177405BC6963F96F776846C14606F2026202600100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉突然跟你搭话，\n你带着呆呆兽吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B497A8171368DDF4F60642D8BDDFF0C000A4F605E26774054465446517D5417FF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在我住的伽勒尔地区，\n提起呆呆兽，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是黄色的脑袋和尾巴，如你所见。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572862114F4F76844F3D52D25C145730533AFF0C000A63D08D7754465446517DFF0C00100001BE00000A5C31662F9EC4827276848111888B548C5C3E5DF4FF0C59824F60624089C1300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是听说在别的地方是不一样的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F542C8BF45728522B7684573065B9662F4E0D4E0068377684300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且，最近在密阿雷\n能见到野生的呆呆兽对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14FF0C67008FD157285BC6963F96F7000A80FD89C1523091CE751F768454465446517D5BF95427FF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "难得来旅行一趟，\n我想和这里的呆呆兽成为伙伴。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96BE5F97676565C5884C4E008D9FFF0C000A621160F3548C8FD991CC768454465446517D62104E3A4F194F34300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是带着呆呆兽的话，就让给我吧。\n我会把伽勒尔地区的呆呆兽给你的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F5E26774054465446517D76848BDDFF0C5C318BA97ED9621154273002000A62114F1A628A4F3D52D25C145730533A768454465446517D7ED94F607684300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是拥有能在密阿雷市\n捉到的呆呆兽，就让给我一只吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F62E5670980FD57285BC6963F96F75E02000A63495230768454465446517DFF0C5C318BA97ED962114E0053EA5427300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意用密阿雷的呆呆兽\n跟我交换伽勒尔的呆呆兽吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F75285BC6963F96F7768454465446517D000A8DDF62114EA463624F3D52D25C14768454465446517D5417FF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好嘞！我们来交换吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D561EFF0162114EEC67654EA463625427300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伽勒尔的呆呆兽\n在这里应该挺罕见的哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F3D52D25C14768454465446517D000A57288FD991CC5E948BE5633A7F5589C1768454E6300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想要的是\n伽勒尔地区没有的呆呆兽。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F389817684662F000A4F3D52D25C145730533A6CA16709768454465446517D300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！它的气味不一样呀。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF015B8376846C1454734E0D4E0068375440300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂，它也太大了吧！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5582FF0C5B834E5F592A59274E865427FF01FF1F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道它的外表会不一样，\n但可没听说会长得这么大啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590535B837684591688684F1A4E0D4E006837FF0C000A4F4653EF6CA1542C8BF44F1A957F5F978FD94E485927554AFF01FF0100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呆～？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5446FF5EFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是看这呆呆的脸……\n果然呆呆兽就是呆呆兽呀！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F770B8FD9544654467684813820262026000A679C713654465446517D5C31662F54465446517D5440FF0100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你给我这么宝贵的呆呆兽，\n我真的太开心了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F607ED962118FD94E485B9D8D35768454465446517DFF0C000A6211771F7684592A5F005FC34E86FF0100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我听说它进化成呆壳兽之后，\n外表会更不一样。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211542C8BF45B838FDB53166210544658F3517D4E4B540EFF0C000A591688684F1A66F44E0D4E006837300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伽勒尔的呆壳兽啊，\n是毒属性……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F3D52D25C147684544658F3517D554AFF0C000A662F6BD25C5E60272026202600100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！我就不多说了，\n你亲自确认吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0162115C314E0D591A8BF44E86FF0C000A4F604EB281EA786E8BA45427300200100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要好好照顾伽勒尔的样子的呆呆兽哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981597D597D7167987E4F3D52D25C14768468375B50768454465446517D54E6FF0100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你给我这么宝贵的呆呆兽，\n要好好照顾伽勒尔的样子的呆呆兽哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F607ED962118FD94E485B9D8D35768454465446517DFF0C000A8981597D597D7167987E4F3D52D25C14768468375B50768454465446517D54E6FF0100100002011401360000",
